<section id="the-claim" class="level3">
<h3 class="anchored" data-anchor-id="the-claim">The Claim</h3>
<p>Dr John argued that if we looked at the data from a <em>specific</em> <em>company</em> (company 11), and from that subset, a specific range (from 7 to 8 tonnes), the data would follow a uniform distribution.</p>
